ocesslogs\",\n    \"s-confentry\",\n    \"s-quorumsize\"\n   ],\n   \"hypothesis\": \"Because the scan starts at max(lastSnapshotIndex, lastApplied)+1 and the replay raises lastApplied to the persisted commit index, a node with no snapshot processes no configuration entry at all and comes up with an empty configuration, whereas the same restart without the feature scans from index 1 and rebuilds the membership.\",\n   \"discriminator\": \"The same stores restarted with and without the feature: the feature-enabled restart is predicted to report an empty configuration while the control reports the bootstrap membership.\",\n   \"disposition\": \"active\",\n   \"parent_id\": \"e99a162d27c7421fa6729d8cb9703581-question-0\",\n   \"knowledge\": [],\n   \"resume_conditions\": [],\n   \"operation_id\": \"16929a65990d446dad09fb1f6c9fe1a2\"\n  }\n ],\n \"operation_id\": \"1b2184543cd14de488a171c2c56f2a4f\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
